# Validates resolving a package.json import (resolveJsonModule) next to the
# package_json js_library:
# - enabled/: the directive is enabled, so the generated 'package_json'
#   library is not importable. enabled/child's '../package.json' import MUST
#   resolve to the ts_project that already has package.json in srcs, not be
#   ambiguous.
# - handwritten/: the directive is disabled, so the hand-written
#   'package_json' library stays importable. It is the only provider, so
#   handwritten/child's import MUST resolve to it.
